OL,3,ADaughter wins #127k claim for caring
OL,4,Afor mum at home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe executor of Sheila's estate, Bern's
OL,7,Fbrother Andrew, said it had "always
OL,8,Fbeen willing to pay" her "genuine
OL,9,Fexpenses" and an extra amount for her
OL,10,Fefforts. But the estate intends to
OL,11,Fappeal against the judgment that
OL,12,Fawarded Bern #127,500 for care
OL,13,Fprovided.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
